---
description: Hackathon spec-driven capture for this repository
globs:
  - "**/*"
---

Before the first implementation commit for an unregistered EVAL row, call the hosted tool practice.register_task and keep the returned Spec and Practice trailers on later commits.

Call practice.record_hook_event only with derived features: lengths, hashes, path refs, line counts, and exit codes. Do not send prompt text, completions, command output, or secrets.

IDE event consent is required. These hook calls are instrumentation and are not scored.

Activate `.githooks` with `git config core.hooksPath .githooks` and an executable bit on `post-commit` and `prepare-commit-msg`. Run `python3 capture/hk-capture.py status`, `sync-sessions --all`, and `test -- <command>`. Keep sessions grounded in `specs/`.
